        <mxCell id="logical-c175" value="&lt;b&gt;Zone rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Card data is entered, processed and held only here.&lt;br&gt;• PIN pads encrypt at the reader (P2PE); registers never see clear card numbers.&lt;br&gt;• Out: PIN pads to the processor (TLS), POS server to HQ1 POS central. Nothing else.&lt;br&gt;• In: HQ1 POS central pushes price files; nothing from STORE, GUEST or IOT.&lt;br&gt;• All CDE ports are on the counter switch SW-02, VLANs 20 to 22 only." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="logical-L2">
