        <mxCell id="logical-c216" value="&lt;b&gt;Store routing and filtering policy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• One routing table on FW-01: every store VLAN is a subinterface of internal1 (trunk to SW-01).&lt;br&gt;• Default deny between zones; each permitted conversation is a row on sheet 7 (F01 to F28).&lt;br&gt;• Default route: SD-WAN (wan1, then wan2 over LTE). Head office prefixes ride the IPsec overlay.&lt;br&gt;• Guest, IOT and store web (F07) leave by the local internet breakout; from the CDE only F01 and F17, to the processor's addresses; from MGMT only the APs' cloud management (F18).&lt;br&gt;• Transit WAN2-LTE (VLAN 98) is a /30 with no hosts: it exists only to reach LTE-01." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="logical-L6">
          <mxGeometry x="1600" y="574" width="770" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="logical-c217" value="&lt;b&gt;Addressing plan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Store nnn uses 10.nnn.0.0/16: third octet = VLAN ID (10.14.20.0/26 is store 014, VLAN 20).&lt;br&gt;• Gateways are .1 on FW-01; DHCP on FW-01 for STORE, GUEST and IOT; CDE is static.&lt;br&gt;• The same VLAN IDs and names in every store; only the second octet changes." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="logical-L6">
          <mxGeometry x="1600" y="800" width="770" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="logical-c218" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;html=1;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="logical-L7">
          <mxGeometry x="1600" y="1042" width="770" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
