        <mxCell id="logical-c237" value="&lt;b&gt;How to extend this sheet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Add a VLAN: add a row to the zone's table and a subinterface row to FW-01's table.&lt;br&gt;• New store: build from NetBox; the prefix ST014- becomes the store's own.&lt;br&gt;• Hide the VLAN tables layer before sharing outside the company." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="logical-L0">
