        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="flows-c180" value="&lt;b&gt;The card&amp;#x27;s journey (F01 to F05, F16, F17)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 1. The customer taps or inserts at PED-0n. The PIN pad encrypts the card data inside the reader (P2PE).&lt;br&gt;• 2. The register sends the amount to its PIN pad (F02) and gets back approved or declined, never the card number.&lt;br&gt;• 3. The PIN pad sends the encrypted card data to the processor (F01), straight out of the store over TLS.&lt;br&gt;• 4. The register records the sale on the POS server (F03), which sends the journal to HQ1 (F04).&lt;br&gt;• 5. Overnight, HQ1 POS central sends price files back (F05).&lt;br&gt;• On a bad day: registers reach HQ1 directly while the POS server is down (F16), and the server drains sales it stored offline to the processor when a line returns (F17)." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="flows-L3">
          <mxGeometry x="1880" y="110" width="480" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="flows-c181" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading the lanes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Left is who starts the conversation; the reply needs no lane of its own.&lt;br&gt;• Green: always allowed. Amber dashed: allowed only on a condition: approval, MFA and a window (F13, F14, F28) or a named failure (F16, F17). Red: denied at FW-01 and logged.&lt;br&gt;• F09 stays inside ZONE IOT: it is drawn so nobody adds a rule for it." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="flows-L3">
          <mxGeometry x="1880" y="460" width="480" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="flows-c182" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;html=1;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="flows-L4">
          <mxGeometry x="1880" y="630" width="480" height="152" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
