        <mxCell id="flows-c195" value="&lt;b&gt;How to extend this sheet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Add a lane: copy a row (pill, both boxes, the arrow) and give it the next free ID.&lt;br&gt;• Then add the same ID to the flow register on sheet 7, and only then to the firewall.&lt;br&gt;• Removing a lane is the same in reverse: register first, then firewall, then this sheet." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="flows-L0">
