        <mxCell id="netbox-c90" value="&lt;b&gt;Nothing in NetBox&amp;#x27;s own schema changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Zones are tags, owners are tenants, software and support dates are custom fields: all additive.&lt;br&gt;• 'netdiagrams netbox-setup --profile retail' creates the tags, roles and custom fields, and changes nothing that already exists." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="netbox-L1">
